s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F086eaffa-f0b9-476d-beb4-54fb4ac646a7_2341x1503.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ziVS!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F086eaffa-f0b9-476d-beb4-54fb4ac646a7_2341x1503.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div></div></div></a>",
